#: .\apps\project\common\pqrs\forms.py:143
msgid ""
"Optional, but it speeds things up: we have to be sure who is asking before "
"handing over or changing personal data."
msgstr ""
"Es opcional, pero agiliza el trámite: tenemos que estar seguros de quién "
"pregunta antes de entregar o modificar datos personales."

#: .\apps\project\common\pqrs\forms.py:161
#: .\apps\project\common\pqrs\models.py:149
msgid "Company name"
msgstr "Razón social"

#: .\apps\project\common\pqrs\forms.py:163
#: .\apps\project\common\pqrs\models.py:151
msgid "Legal representative"
msgstr "Representante legal"

#: .\apps\project\common\pqrs\forms.py:166
#: .\apps\project\common\pqrs\models.py:183
msgid "Certificate of existence and legal representation"
msgstr "Certificado de existencia y representación legal"

#: .\apps\project\common\pqrs\forms.py:169
msgid "It is what shows the representative can act for the company."
msgstr "Es lo que acredita que el representante puede actuar por la empresa."

#: .\apps\project\common\pqrs\forms.py:185
#: .\apps\project\common\pqrs\models.py:105
msgid "NIT"
msgstr "NIT"

#: .\apps\project\common\pqrs\forms.py:200
msgid "Description of the request"
msgstr "Descripción de la solicitud"

#: .\apps\project\common\pqrs\forms.py:205
msgid ""
"Say what happened and what you are asking for. If it is about a specific "
"record, quoting its reference saves a round trip."
msgstr ""
"Cuéntanos qué pasó y qué solicitas. Si se trata de un registro concreto, "
"indicar su referencia ahorra una ida y vuelta."

#: .\apps\project\common\pqrs\forms.py:218
msgid "Use the contact details I gave above"
msgstr "Usar los datos de contacto que di arriba"

#: .\apps\project\common\pqrs\forms.py:224
#: .\apps\project\common\pqrs\models.py:194
msgid "Contact email"
msgstr "Correo de contacto"

#: .\apps\project\common\pqrs\forms.py:226
#: .\apps\project\common\pqrs\models.py:196
msgid "Contact mobile"
msgstr "Celular de contacto"

#: .\apps\project\common\pqrs\forms.py:228
